# Vulnerability details

## Description
BathBuddy rewards are handed out over time to users taking part in the pools (compound cTokens).

Since Positions have no way of redeeming these rewards users holding positions lose out on BathBuddy rewards.

The `COMP` (or similar) token rewards are possible to redeem since a user can redeem on behalf of another user, then use `Position::withdraw` to fetch them.

## Impact
Holders of positions lose out on BathBuddy rewards for their `bathToken` (`cToken`) holdings

