# Funds can be stolen from market contract using reentrancy

When closing a leverage position with `Position::closePosition`, there is no reentrancy guard and CEI is not followed. This means that a malicious user can reenter the function and steal funds from the market contract.

## Impact

See below the function used to close a position taken from the `Position` contract:

```solidity
    /// @notice entry-point to close opened position
