## Impact

Creating an offer with both `owner` and `recipient` equal to address(0) renders the offer untakeable and causes it to revert every time. If the offer is set to be the best offer in the order book, then it blocks any other offer from being taken by matching (because the best offer always reverts).

A malicious user can exploit this to paralyze the market and prevent any trading activity.

