1. When creating a new offer, there is no check that the recipient address is not zero - [(link)](https://github.com/code-423n4/2023-04-rubicon/blob/main/contracts/RubiconMarket.sol#L532).

2. When creating new offers, the `RubikonMarket` contract first tries to buy existing offers in the other direction. [(link)]( https://github.com/code-423n4/2023-04-rubicon/blob/main/contracts/RubiconMarket.sol#L1313)

