The issue is with the usage of 'this.offer'. The usage of 'this.' in Solidity results in an external call that changes the msg.sender to the calling contract: in this case, the RubiconMarket contract. The malicious user 'alice' can exploit this by creating and buying a highly favorable sell offer using the RubiconMarket contracts own funds. In the following PoC, alice used the vulnerability to create a sell offer of 100 WETH in exchange for 1 USDC 

The exploit can be ran multiple times to drain all the ERC20's the contract is holding.

