## Impact

Calling `RubiconMarket.offer` with `owner` parameter set to `address(0)` will lead to `pay_amt` funds being [stuck forever](https://github.com/code-423n4/2023-04-rubicon/blob/main/contracts/RubiconMarket.sol#L538) on the `RubiconMarket`, as the legitimate owner will not be able to cancel (since `can_cancel` [will revert](https://github.com/code-423n4/2023-04-rubicon/blob/main/contracts/RubiconMarket.sol#L610-L618)) and `buy`s [will also revert](https://github.com/code-423n4/2023-04-rubicon/blob/main/contracts/RubiconMarket.sol#L360), as token transfers will attempt to `address(0)`.

