# Vulnerability details

## Description

Users are able to make offers against the `Rubiconmarket` contract via the `_matcho()` function which will attempt to automatically match the offer with the best already existing offer however, the `_matcho()` function does not consider the case where the best offer is created by the same user. 

## Impact

Should this case be satisfied, the user’s trade will go through with themselves, and they will immediately lose assets to fees. 

## Proof of Concept

The proof of concept below outlines this scenario:

