## Impact
LP rewards are distributed to liquidity providers as per their deposit amount, meaning each unit of underlying token user stake, earns some amount of reward tokens, this is determined by **Reward Per Token**.
However, attacker can front-run and manipulate **Reward Per Token** to drain the rewards in a short time (likely in 2 blocks).

## Proof of Concept
In BathBuddy.sol, **Reward Per Token** is calculated in [**rewardPerToken(address token)**](https://github.com/code-423n4/2023-04-rubicon/blob/511636d889742296a54392875a35e4c0c4727bb7/contracts/periphery/BathBuddy.sol#L121-L135):
