## Impact
Buy function can be Dos

## Proof of Concept
In the `RubiconMarket` contract, the `offer` function does not check if input `recipient` is zero-address.  A malicious user can create very attractive offers like trading 1 WETH for 1 USDC but set recipient to `address(0)` and then when people call `buy`, it will revert since some ERC20 tokens will revert on zero-address transfers (USDC for example https://optimistic.etherscan.io/token/0x7f5c764cbc14f9669b88837ca1490cca17c31607#code). 
