# Vulnerability details

## Impact

`BathBuddy.earned()` does not take into account for how long a user holds BathTokens in order to calculate how many rewards they have earned. This means that `user A` can be staked for a long time, eg., a year, and `user B` may have just staked a couple of seconds ago and when both users try to claim rewards at the same time, they will get a similar payoff when `user A` should be getting far more rewards.

